- Do not spawn subagents or delegate to Task, Explore, Bash, or Browser agents.
- Do not use MCP tools or plugins other than this policy plugin.
- Never commit, push, publish, open a pull request, or access credentials.
- Stay within the current workspace and respect its repository instructions.
- In Ask mode, remain read-only. In Agent mode, leave all edits uncommitted.
